WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.137
So who should open which page first?

2
00:00:02.137 --> 00:00:05.500
An engineer running the kits
opens the Command Reference.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.713
An ISSO or a control
assessor opens the RMF Map.

4
00:00:09.713 --> 00:00:16.000
An authorizing official reads the RMF Map,
then the M-19-17 and FICAM Crosswalk.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.588
A CIO or program lead starts with
the Federal Framework Crosswalk.

6
00:00:20.588 --> 00:00:25.374
An identity or cloud architect opens
the Microsoft Practice Crosswalk.

7
00:00:25.374 --> 00:00:28.630
And anyone citing a source
uses the Source Register.
